#. module: edi_epostak_connector_sapi
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:edi_epostak_connector_sapi.field_res_config_settings__epostak_inbound_health
msgid ""
"Receiving has no other signal: the base poll swallows failures into the log,"
" so without this a misconfiguration stops inbound silently while sending "
"still reports errors on the invoice. A stale timestamp here is the evidence "
"that documents are no longer arriving."
msgstr ""
"Prijímanie nemá žiadny iný signál: základné vyzdvihovanie zapíše zlyhania "
"len do logu, takže bez tohto by chybné nastavenie potichu zastavilo "
"prijímanie, zatiaľ čo odosielanie hlási chyby na faktúre. Zastaraný čas tu "
"dokazuje, že doklady prestali prichádzať."

#. module: edi_epostak_connector_sapi
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:edi_epostak_connector_sapi.view_res_config_settings_epostak_sapi
msgid ""
"Receiving reports nothing by itself — a failed or"
"                               never-run poll is otherwise only visible in "
"the                               server log."
msgstr ""
"Prijímanie samo nič nehlási — zlyhané alebo nikdy\n"
"                              nespustené vyzdvihovanie je inak vidieť len\n"
"                              v serverovom logu."

